      "text": "The R-### numbering system encodes molecular structure. You don't need to memorize\nthe formula, but understanding the naming helps decode the letter prefixes:"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-REFRIGERANTS.md#007",
      "path": [
        "03-REFRIGERANTS.md"
