        "title": "Refrigerants",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  CFC  = Chlorofluorocarbon     (ex: R-12, R-11, R-502)\n         Chlorine + Fluorine + Carbon\n         ODP ≠ 0 (chlorine → catalytic ozone destruction)"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-REFRIGERANTS.md#008",
      "path": [
        "03-REFRIGERANTS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:hvac:03-refrigerants, git-history:hvac:03-refrigerants]",
