        "root_concepts": "[refrigerants]",
        "section": "hvac",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Refrigerants",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "HCFC = Hydrochlorofluorocarbon (ex: R-22, R-123)\n         Hydrogen + Chlorine + Fluorine + Carbon\n         Lower ODP than CFC (hydrogen reduces atmospheric lifetime)"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-REFRIGERANTS.md#009",
      "path": [
        "03-REFRIGERANTS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
