      },
      "text": "HFC  = Hydrofluorocarbon      (ex: R-410A, R-134a, R-32)\n         Hydrogen + Fluorine + Carbon — NO chlorine\n         ODP = 0, but high GWP"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-REFRIGERANTS.md#010",
